# Active skills are user-local state (badi skills add). The repo ships only
# .gitkeep + README.md here; ignore every activated skill subdir so a stray
# `git add -A` can't re-commit one (regression caught in review #277 — an
# expo skill leaked into .claude/skills/ and rode package.json files[] to npm).
.claude/skills/*/
.test-tmp/
.test-tmp-*/
.hook-sandbox/

